    "body": "Merged upstream `main` into `issue/937-mcp-wcs-from-features` now that #706 has merged (merge `34093c3e`, head `def6bd8d`).\n\n- `crates/app/src/pick/roles.rs`: conflict resolved by taking main's side (#706 carries the identical `(Role::Z, Role::Y)` arm fix). This PR no longer touches that file.\n- `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION`: main is on 30, so this PR takes 31 (it still changes the camcraft-mcp skill).\n- #706 reworded the roles law's too-few-axes refusal to \"set the WCS from two axes, plus an optional origin\". `mcp_wcs_features` now pins that text (test-only commit `def6bd8d`).\n- `git diff upstream/main --stat`: only this PR's 7 files (wcs_tools.rs, mcp/mod.rs, mcp/tools.rs, tests/mcp_wcs_features.rs, decision file, skill row, PROCESS_VERSION).\n\nGate on the final head `def6bd8d`: `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` ran 27 app binaries including `mcp_wcs_features` (2/2) and passed. `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` is clean. Ready for a re-check.\n",
